{"unit_id":"nienieai__dsh-chime-alerts#feature-1","repo":"nienieai/dsh-chime-alerts","commit":"da32b8cfe01cda6179e43185155b79117dd595e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime-alerts 的功能「十类事件提醒」：记录任务完成、授权、提问、计划评审、目标受阻、打断及后台任务状态，并将宿主捕获的事件交给客户端提醒。事件由宿主记录，客户端接收。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:70-76","lib/host.js:605-615"]}
{"unit_id":"nienieai__dsh-chime-alerts#feature-2","repo":"nienieai/dsh-chime-alerts","commit":"da32b8cfe01cda6179e43185155b79117dd595e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime-alerts 的功能「按事件选择提醒方式」：用户可为每类事件选择关闭、响铃或通知，并设置通知等级；客户端设置页提供对应的逐事件选项。。通过 DSH Web 设置页配置或由宿主事件触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:591-604","lib/client.web.js:292-310"]}
{"unit_id":"nienieai__dsh-chime-alerts#feature-3","repo":"nienieai/dsh-chime-alerts","commit":"da32b8cfe01cda6179e43185155b79117dd595e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime-alerts 的功能「工作区静音」：用户可以切换某个工作区的静音状态，静音工作区的提醒会被跳过，侧栏工作区旁还会显示只读标记。。通过 DSH Web 设置页配置或由宿主事件触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.web.js:1108-1122","lib/client.web.js:1804-1809"]}
{"unit_id":"nienieai__dsh-chime-alerts#feature-4","repo":"nienieai/dsh-chime-alerts","commit":"da32b8cfe01cda6179e43185155b79117dd595e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime-alerts 的功能「双语设置页」：在 DSH 设置中提供声音提醒页面，文字随 DSH locale 显示中文或英文。打开设置页即可调整提醒选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.web.js:2000-2014"]}
{"unit_id":"nienieai__dsh-chime-alerts#caveat-1","repo":"nienieai/dsh-chime-alerts","commit":"da32b8cfe01cda6179e43185155b79117dd595e4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime-alerts 使用前须知：页面关闭后，只有已配置为宿主提醒的事件仍可提醒；浏览器侧提醒需要页面运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:73-76","lib/client.web.js:585-610"]}
